  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1004.11 Field Waivers Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1004.11 Field Waivers Prohibited. No field waivers shall be granted to accommodate non-conformance with approved plans or inaccurate information on approved plans or for any other reason.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1004.12)",
